# Pitantir

A website for tracking historically significant Minecraft book items, their identities, locations, movements, and shared location histories.

## Documentation

Implementation has not started. Design docs:

| Document | Description |
|---|---|
| [SPEC.md](./SPEC.md) | Product & technical specification |
| [ARCHITECTURE.md](./ARCHITECTURE.md) | System architecture and stack |
| [DATA_MODEL.md](./DATA_MODEL.md) | Database entities, constraints, deletion behavior |
| [ITEM_IDENTITY.md](./ITEM_IDENTITY.md) | Identity resolution, merges, splits, nonce collisions |
| [SCANNING_RULES.md](./SCANNING_RULES.md) | Scan lifecycle, observations, location inference |
| [IMPORT_FORMAT.md](./IMPORT_FORMAT.md) | External historical import schema |
| [MVP_TASKS.md](./MVP_TASKS.md) | Ordered, testable implementation tasks |
| [CLAUDE.md](./CLAUDE.md) | Working rules for implementers and agents |

Start with `SPEC.md`, then follow `MVP_TASKS.md` for build order.

Upstream item search providers: see [ITEM_DATA_PROVIDERS.md](./ITEM_DATA_PROVIDERS.md).
